ce<\/strong>: Nomex needle-punched felt also has good wear resistance and can adapt to various types of high-efficiency and high-intensity filtering work.<\/li><li>In addition,\u00a0nomex needle-punched felt also has the advantages of good air permeability, high dust collection efficiency, large dust holding capacity, and long service life.<\/li><\/ul><h3>Processing and Surface Treatment<\/h3><p>Filmedia\u00ae uses high-quality aramid fibers as raw materials, adopts international advanced standards, and uses advanced production equipment to manufacture aramid high-temperature resistant needle-punched filter felts. The aramid fiber filter material is combined with the surface layer and the base cloth layer through multiple needle punching, and then after singeing and calendering, the whole is impregnated with PTFE (polytetrafluoroethylene), and then its surface is sintered at high temperature to form a dense protection membrane. Thereby greatly improving the overall performance of the filter material.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fbd645c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fbd645c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5119d26 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5119d26\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Anti-Static-\u8be6\u60c51-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3222\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Anti-Static-\u8be6\u60c51-2.jpg 200w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Anti-Static-\u8be6